  },
  "nav": {
   "x": 9200,
   "y": 3420,
   "w": 420,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "blue",
   "text": "How you get around\n\n• One SpeakType window. Its sidebar holds History and every settings page, so nothing is orphaned.\n• Menu bar → History… (⌘Y) or Settings… (⌘,) opens that window on the right page.\n• Session bar → Review → quick review panel → \"Open in History\" jumps to that session's Timeline.\n• Inside History: Timeline · Result · Details tabs switch in place.\n• Press Play on any window board and click the sidebar, tabs or links to move between boards."
  },
  "t6": {
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 3200,
   "text": "Menu bar, updates and empty states",
   "w": 240,
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5600
  },
  "flow": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 4530,
   "w": 1400,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "blue",
   "text": "How first run is presented: one 960 × 640 window, centred. Each step slides in from the right; Back and Continue at the bottom right. Continue unlocks only when a required step is done (mic and Accessibility auto-detect and move on by themselves). Quitting midway resumes at the same step next launch, and the widget shows a 'Finish setup' dot until done. Step 5 isn't part of the window: it appears the first time you start a session."
  }
